## SQ-DRK-02 | juice recipes: pot and Kettle rule, upstream recipes removed
@group A
@commands Recipe probe (`/recipescan` or a RecipeManager id dump) for `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/*_juice_manual_only`, `creativedelight:farmersrespitebrewing/*_juice`, `*_tea`, `*_coffee_from_coffee`
@pass Pot juices for bayberry, hamimelon, chorus, lychee, hawberry, kiwi, lemon, mango, mangosteen, melon, orange, peach, pear, carrot, turnip (4 fruit + 1 sugar-like, glass bottle, 1 out), dandelion (2 leaves + 2 sugar cane), pickerelweed and sea grape (2 + 2 sugar); Kettle juices 2 fruit on water; nautilus Kettle into a nautilus shell; absent: `farmersdelight:cooking/bayberry_soup`, `farmersrespite:brewing/melon_juice`, `farmersrespite:brewing/dandelion_tea`, `hostiledelight:cucumbertearecp`, `delightful:food/cooking/ender_nectar`, `ends_delight:food/chorus_fruit_milk_tea`, `quarkdelight:cooking/cloud_latte`, the five `fruitsdelight:mixing/flowing_*_tea`; the old `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/{carrot,dandelion,turnip_water,chorus}_juice_manual_only` and `pickerelweed_juice` gone
@fails removal id wrong (upstream id differs): add it; `CD.on` false for a mod
