@pass pots take `rusticdelight:roasted_coffee_beans` only (no raw beans), chocolate takes `#creativeengineering:coffee_chocolate`, pumpkin `#creativeengineering:coffee_pumpkin`; the Kettle brews Chocolate Coffee from the plain coffee tank; heated mixer recipes `creativedelight:createmixing/{coffee,dark_coffee,milk_coffee,<flavour>_coffee,<flavour>_coffee_from_coffee}` exist
@fails replaceInput did not match the FD cooking schema: rebuild the recipes by hand
