## SQ-DRK-06 | drink_fruits tags filled (rest of the row PASSed in the first run)
@group A
@commands `/dumptags item` and `fluid`; eat each new item (fake player or `/give` + use)
@pass `#creativeengineering:azalea_flowers` = Twigs' and Immersive Weathering's; `pink_flowers`, `lavender_tea_herbs`, `coffee_chocolate`, `coffee_pumpkin`, `drink_fruits/*`, `sea_pickles` filled; `forge:fluid/<name>` for the 17 fluids; the 14 items are in `#creativeengineering:food_type/drink`, stack to 32, give 1 hunger and return a glass bottle
@fails food_types member script not regenerated (`tools/food_catalog.py --members`)
