## CQ-DRK-01
@group C
@commands Client with the rebuilt CD jar; JEI the new teas and juices; hover the renamed drinks; drink one
@pass 14 sprites (mug teas, bottle juices) with no missing texture; names Turnip Juice, Sea Pickle Tea, Chorus Fruit Bubble Tea, Ice Berry Matcha, Chorus Tea (and the Turnip Juice, Ice Berry Matcha and Chorus Tea fluids); drinking plays the drink animation
